cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, the recovered patient map, or the patient-disjoint split, please cite it as below."
title: "Brain Tumor MRI Benchmark Audit: patient-identifier recovery, leakage analysis, and a patient-disjoint split"
abstract: >-
  Audit tooling and corrected evaluation splits for a widely used four-class
  brain tumor MRI benchmark. Recovers figshare patient identifiers for the
  aggregated release by crop-normalized, orientation-invariant content
  matching; documents complete patient-level leakage and 16.5% duplicate
  contamination between the released train and test folders; and provides a
  fixed five-fold patient-disjoint cross-validation partition together with
  the full training, evaluation and interpretability pipeline.
